# Obtain new stress tensor

variable tmp equal pxx
variable pxx1 equal ${tmp}
variable pxx1 equal 0.0998607121206891
variable tmp equal pyy
variable pyy1 equal ${tmp}
variable pyy1 equal 0.106146584376007
variable tmp equal pzz
variable pzz1 equal ${tmp}
variable pzz1 equal 0.115336183960778
variable tmp equal pxy
variable pxy1 equal ${tmp}
variable pxy1 equal 10.0259103899273
variable tmp equal pxz
variable pxz1 equal ${tmp}
variable pxz1 equal -27.2261593198555
variable tmp equal pyz
variable pyz1 equal ${tmp}
variable pyz1 equal -13.2757229585259

# Compute elastic constant from pressure tensor

variable C1neg equal ${d1}
variable C1neg equal -0.928454857738689
variable C2neg equal ${d2}
variable C2neg equal 0.251157651907501
variable C3neg equal ${d3}
variable C3neg equal -0.0339438650860002
variable C4neg equal ${d4}
variable C4neg equal -0.559168463450099
variable C5neg equal ${d5}
variable C5neg equal -0.273891773240109
variable C6neg equal ${d6}
variable C6neg equal 89.6478569854962

# Reset box and simulation parameters

clear
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread. (src/comm.cpp:98)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
box tilt large
read_restart restart.equil
Reading restart file ...
  restart file = 29 Sep 2021, LAMMPS = 29 Sep 2021
  restoring atom style atomic from restart
  triclinic box = (0.16990242 0.17232694 0.17095262) to (35.800098 35.797673 35.799047) with tilt (0.0000000 0.0000000 0.0000000)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
